'''Junior God Brynhildr''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.4 Update|Version 4.4]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Yurudrasil Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 233
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Junior God Brynhildr
|name2 = Junior God Brynhildr CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Junior God Brynhildr CC''' at level 10

==Strategy/Usage==
Brynhildr is essentially a [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Mer-Cat]] that trades damage, recharge time and [[Survive|Survive]] for a little extra range and speed, which is hardly worth it. While she does outrange [[Teacher Bun Bun]], this is also true for Mer-Cat's [[True Form]]. Once Cameraman Cat is unlocked, you can safely discard her for good.

